    "answer": {
      "short": "$6\\text{ cm}$. With shorter side $x$, $x+x+4x+4x=60$.",
      "worked": "Let $x$ be the shorter side length in centimetres. The longer side is $4x$ centimetres.\n$$\\begin{align*}\nx+x+4x+4x &= 60 \\\\\n10x &= 60 \\\\\nx &= 6\n\\end{align*}$$\nThe shorter side is $6\\text{ cm}$.\nCheck: $6+6+24+24=60\\text{ cm}$.",
      "solutionDiagrams": []
    },
